.TH "zelta\-propsync" "8" "" "" "System Manager\(cqs Manual"
.SH NAME
\f[B]zelta propsync\f[R] \- sync local ZFS properties between dataset
trees
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]zelta propsync\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]] \f[I]source\f[R]
\f[I]target\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The property synchronization step is documented under
\f[B]zelta\-failover(8)\f[R].
It replays local ZFS properties while preserving target\-only local
overrides before a promoted target takes over service.
.SH SEE ALSO
zelta\-failover(8), zelta(8), zfs(8)
